      "id": "GENUS_CHUNGA",
      "name": "Chunga",
      "rank": "GENUS",
      "description": "A monotypic genus of seriema similar to Cariama but slightly smaller and less crested. The Black-legged Seriema occupies drier, more arid habitats than its red-legged relative.",
